| UI-21 | `NPCGoodsDialog`, `NPCSellDialog`, `NPCRepairDialog`, `NPCRefineDialog`, `NPCRefineRetrieveDialog` |
| UI-22 | `NPCQuestDialog` |
| UI-23 | `NPCAdoptCompanionDialog`, `NPCCompanionStorageDialog`, `NPCWeddingRingDialog` |
| UI-24 | `NPCRefinementStoneDialog`, `NPCItemFragmentDialog`, `NPCMasterRefineDialog`, `NPCAccessoryUpgradeDialog`, `NPCAccessoryLevelDialog`, `NPCAccessoryResetDialog`, `NPCWeaponCraftWindow` |

